## 7. RBAC and ABAC Comparison

| Aspect | RBAC | ABAC |
|--------|-------|------|
| Basis | Roles | Attributes (user, resource, state) |
| Flexibility | Low | High |
| Example | "Approver can approve audits" | "Approver can approve audits only if record.status='Submitted' and user.region=record.region" |
| Fit for CogniAiOps | Partial | Best for contextual AI orchestration |

CogniAiOps effectively implements **Dynamic ABAC** â€” learned from user behavior rather than pre-coded rules.

